  "description": "We are pleased to present the Ardhu Apartments which offers residents luxury rental accommodation within a quiet and leafy private development. \n\n\n•  1 bed 1-bathroom apartment €2,050 per month\n\n•  2 bed 2-bathroom apartment €2,650 per month\n\n•  2 bed 2-bathroom apartments €2,800 per month\n\n•  2 bed 2-bathroom Penthouse apartment €3,000 per month\n\nArdhu offers beautifully designed and furnished one-, two- & three-bedroom residences. The stylish, open-plan living rooms have been designed to make the most of the natural light with generous windows and ceiling heights. \n\nContemporary kitchens with quality appliances are central to the luxury living experience at Ardhu. Floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes maximize storage space for residents and oak flooring completes the fresh modern feel. \n\nNestled in a prime location Ardhu is easily accessed by bus or car. \n\nBy Bus: \n\n• Bus 343 takes just 5 minutes to reach the city centre, where you’ll find a variety of amenities and major companies like Verizon and EY\n\nBy Car: \n\n•  The Raheen Business Park and UHL is just a 15-minute drive by car making Eli Lilly, Regeneron easily accessible. Alternative Edwards Lifesciences and Johnson & Johnson are just a 20-minute drive away which are located in the Castletroy and Annacotty area. \n\n• • • We welcome applicants from HomeHak. Viewing's now available • • • \n\nPlease contact via email or phone 061 639 179",
